      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "きんいろの　きれいな　おうかん。\nぎんのおうかんより　めずらしい。\nわたすと　よろこぶ　ひともいる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "금색의 아름다운 왕관.\n은왕관보다 진귀하다.\n받으면 좋아하는 사람도 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "金色的美麗王冠。\n比銀色王冠更珍貴。\n有些人收到它會很高興。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une jolie capsule en or, encore plus rare\nque la Capsule d’Argent.\nCertaines personnes adorent en recevoir.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein hübscher goldener Kronkorken. Er ist noch\nseltener als ein Silberkronkorken. Es gibt Leute,\ndie sich sehr darüber freuen würden!",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una bonita chapa de color dorado, menos común\nque su equivalente plateada. Hay gente que las\naprecia mucho.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un bel tappo a corona color oro, più raro del\nTappo d’argento. Alcuni lo apprezzano molto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A beautiful bottle cap that gives off a golden gleam.\nSome people are happy to receive one.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "金色の　きれいな　王冠。\nぎんのおうかんより　珍しい。\n渡すと　よろこぶ　人もいる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
